            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta compilación no indica dónde está su código fuente: no la generó el flujo de publicación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This part of the recording couldn't be read: the frame before it is shown." : {
      "comment" : "Editor banner: the playhead is in a part of the video that couldn't be read",
